nd medicine. The Russian-occupied town has been devastated by fighting and flooding since Moscow's invasion in 2022.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US seeks new charges against former FBI chief James Comey</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:773572bdf2965d20989cbb38e198457ded7075fc995369ce41bc5621e49c358d</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:48Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T01:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-seeks-new-charges-against-former-fbi-chief-james-comey/a-79771256--b8a272db5879.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-seeks-new-charges-against-former-fbi-chief-james-comey/a-79771256?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Trump administration accuses the former FBI director of leaking classified information a decade ago. Comey denies wrongdoing, while his lawyers argue the case is legally invalid and comes too late.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>England and Bayern Munich striker Harry Kane wins Ballon d'Or</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ff21d1ab64358e5a1f8bd28e4c8eb702899a1c1a5d0bc47ba27747247a4d0f01</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:51Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T23:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/england-and-bayern-munich-striker-harry-kane-wins-ballon-d-or/a-79771067--21e06316b487.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/england-and-bayern-munich-striker-harry-kane-wins-ballon-d-or/a-79771067?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The England captain ends his country's 25-year wait for the prestigious award after scoring 73 goals for club and country last season, beating competition from Lamine Yamal and Kylian Mbappe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Jordan says its military struck 'militant hideouts' in Syria after deadly church attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7678179a94cd1680b9deb404591b3a0c8b46fe62582712815ff671f7031022fc</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:54Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T22:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/jordan-says-its-military-struck-militant-hideouts-in-syria-after-deadly-church-attack/a-79760441--3812591acdd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/jordan-says-its-military-struck-militant-hideouts-in-syria-after-deadly-church-attack/a-79760441?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jordanian armed forces carried out strikes on "militant hideouts" in Syria that it said were linked to a deadly church attack on the kingdom last week. Syria gave a different account.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UN sounds the alarm over Israel's West Bank military operation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4b87fa3df9fb74bbb8f3493f054e95ef9867cd48b1868e998fd1ab7ced84b9cb</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T20:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/un-sounds-the-alarm-over-israel-s-west-bank-military-operation/a-79770228--2f8db957dcd2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/un-sounds-the-alarm-over-israel-s-west-bank-military-operation/a-79770228?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The UN has sounded the alarm on Israeli action in the West Bank city of Hebron after hundreds of families were displaced at the weekend. Israel has ordered the military to demolish homes after soldiers were killed there.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>A bad omen? Syria bans women from university courses</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0a655ddd0686375da31ae3348b7b252ca87a115dcfb85d04cd4d1bcee9904c8f</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T20:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/a-bad-omen-syria-bans-women-from-university-courses/a-79769348--ba55f3eb7dc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" h