d further cruises could be affected.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What Germany thinks of carmaker Audi's $4 billion deal with Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f01f3b5d2a5d4453e9e19f9d05e6d1052dbabdde0c26f2b228f604d8baaa4035</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T15:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-germany-thinks-of-carmaker-audi-s-4-billion-deal-with-trump/a-79760479--6c6f86b95e86.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-germany-thinks-of-carmaker-audi-s-4-billion-deal-with-trump/a-79760479?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The luxury carmaker is set to open its first factory in the United States — a move Trump credits to his tariffs. DW examines the German reaction amid a massive auto industry cull at home.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Why Ukraine may be involved in Mali's conflict</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0ed0ef7bb1497fb734146f8129c26a80baff6690efa1eb98e7d42b24a6e2d9b5</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-ukraine-may-be-involved-in-mali-s-conflict/a-79743423--7ee87f683a22.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-ukraine-may-be-involved-in-mali-s-conflict/a-79743423?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Allegations that Ukrainian specialists are supporting Tuareg rebels in Mali highlight Kyiv's effort to challenge Russian influence far beyond the battlefield in Europe.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Macron vows 'strong measures' to combat protests that rocked France</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:edb6024bba1d263d12435bc7be686f51d14217706e78fdee69aa6b5a7cc5ca49</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T13:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en