hy the connection is complicated</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da1aa0cf0843af6b8fcda592808e899282c1999c8386717a22dd3fc1e406970f</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T08:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/from-rotten-food-to-political-opponents-researchers-explore-how-disgust-relates-to-our-beliefs-and-w/a-79734659--e9b7cd7e436d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/from-rotten-food-to-political-opponents-researchers-explore-how-disgust-relates-to-our-beliefs-and-why-the-connection-is-complicated/a-79734659?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Some studies have linked disgust sensitivity to socially conservative attitudes. But ahead of the US midterm elections, does disgust shape our politics, or do our beliefs shape what we find disgusting?</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Remark on Modi's father stirs political row</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e643c539b022845029e5f11883fb221ae4cd2176517b2115f4560047c6634375</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T07:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-remark-on-modi-s-father-stirs-political-row/live-79758965--7e6cacdc5195.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-remark-on-modi-s-father-stirs-political-row/live-79758965?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An opposition leader's impromptu remark concerning PM Modi is causing a political stir in India with the ruling party now planning a protest. Also, the prince of Liechtenstein is in Mumbai.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Serbia election: Vucic concedes defeat to student-led movement</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3afb6ce2f244449138b794e7727fc1a2e80bbe9dcd46eb27fc64875ddb03e590</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:17:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T21:07:00Z</published><link rel="alterna